{"title":"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/b/20b494039a8b1aae0848c4e26c5fc485024d1882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/3/583923f7854c55f894c39fa740c94fb5d532a68a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a859acebdd07c34704648be45c0daf108e2a29d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/4/ca4b7985dcfae6c303599bda88b43a2c89dfa051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   10  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   11  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   12  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   13 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   14  \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"430\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/3/583923f7854c55f894c39fa740c94fb5d532a68a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/3/ce3872ac3736e29d298a70169daf784b70234bf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />. Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/b/20b494039a8b1aae0848c4e26c5fc485024d1882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/d/e9dd9894392e21f74a4fe927f525185d1c77c8b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y + 5)y = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/d/28d9547886b652e940cbd8fa73bc332d10531d3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^{2} + 5y - 24 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>The factors that add multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/6150a3eb8a4b0f17b6b4f30949748fbeb58b5a11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" /> and add to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b31b51deaa1a9e903d120a02141556c3e70e348.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/3/7f3c1cc1118b83c021650cd354cf43fd76295c4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^{2} + 8y - 3y - 24 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"174\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/e/55ed598fb09ff79230068ae00d450a03955e8914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y(y + 8) - 3(y + 8) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"186\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/3/8b3f56c4648a6eab79c4cffe981863c15ad06b6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y - 3)(y + 8) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We see that either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/9/7c9844b33c8a1653bead3d2d7ec0616816c9834a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/973e36b4fe88dc6180688cf626b7fdce4ab82331.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + 8 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/6389a3877e2c9d09826aa0c5e5aa564d8c355afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/8/7b8aca4e3bbe4b67c7e6b3907b26a857c6cc8823.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are positive numbers, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/6389a3877e2c9d09826aa0c5e5aa564d8c355afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />. We could have also gotten these roots using the quadratic formula.\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/6389a3877e2c9d09826aa0c5e5aa564d8c355afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/3/583923f7854c55f894c39fa740c94fb5d532a68a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/845e3dd405fd740bdebbc89acc7b2bf3d3b8f8a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 3 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/4/62434ae80ca145c20f0fbc7563f5151371ed163c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a859acebdd07c34704648be45c0daf108e2a29d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/5/7b54c18fd79a5d0465d0b72b6e900bb4e56eebbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 + 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"131\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/3/583923f7854c55f894c39fa740c94fb5d532a68a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/3/ce3872ac3736e29d298a70169daf784b70234bf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />. Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/b/20b494039a8b1aae0848c4e26c5fc485024d1882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/d/e9dd9894392e21f74a4fe927f525185d1c77c8b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y + 5)y = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is a positive integer and must be a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/6/136ca34ed3369bb0ce47b455fd3069fdfd0dc1fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"17\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The only pair of factors where one number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than the lower number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/6389a3877e2c9d09826aa0c5e5aa564d8c355afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Next, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a859acebdd07c34704648be45c0daf108e2a29d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26cab3f0704de3232f601b03d02a45d46103c172.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/5/fd5c0a0f370ccf9702de26c839b7bffb5f9be88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/9/f69e69e7aa57865437b06961b56b79c1d801a854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = x - y + 2y = 5 + 2 \\times 3 = 5 + 6 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"400\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat\">2014 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 17 (page does not exist)\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 18 (page does not exist)\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 22 (page does not exist)\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"CEMC Fermat\">CEMC Fermat</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232031\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 292/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2050/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 310/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8522/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.035      1 Template:CEMC_box\n100.00%    9.035      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36374:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017232031 and revision id 281545. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}